// Generated by the engine, not written by hand. To refresh it against a newer
// FTE, enter "pr_dumpplatform -Tcs" in its console and copy here the
// src/fteextensions.qc it writes in the game directory. The flag cannot follow
// "+pr_dumpplatform" on FTE's command line, where an argument that starts with
// "-" ends the command; put the line in a .cfg file and "+exec" that.
fteextensions.qc

